122	/// Clone `source` into `target` as a colocated repo (`jj git
123	/// clone --colocate <source> <target>`): init, add `origin`,
124	/// fetch + track the default bookmark, and check out its head.
125	/// The network legs stay jj-lib's own `git` children.
